{"id":"suavemente","lemma":"suavemente","pos":"adv","rank":3960,"glosses":["softly"],"ipa":"/ˌswabeˈmente/","order":3961,"examples":[{"text":"Él golpeó suavemente a la puerta.","en":"He quietly knocked at the door.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"}]},{"text":"Ella cantó suavemente la canción.","en":"She sang the song softly.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to sing","l":"cantar"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"song"}]},{"text":"La madre depositó su bebe sobre la cama suavemente.","en":"The mother laid her baby on the bed softly.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to deposit","l":"depositar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bed"},null]}]}